      Body   : Moved and renamed several entity and animation files for better organization, especially for Formidibomb and related entities. Updated Formidibomb attachable animations and models, and removed unused or obsolete files. Adjusted witherstorm and Formidibomb logic, including improved damage immunity and visual effects. Simplified amulet attachable textures and render controllers.

