[176] 49ed121b49a10c6ef7b5683ed7757b1e5a625200 | 2025-11-22 23:20:05 -0300 | dt=+38243s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: 9727598e8d218d87c5a163c63b0c873a349262f1
      Subject: Update block format versions to 1.21.110
      Stat   : 118 files changed, 8213 insertions(+), 793 deletions(-)
      Body   : Updated the 'format_version' field from 1.21.40 to 1.21.110 in all block JSON files for compatibility with the latest Minecraft Bedrock format. Also removed unused 'menu_category' from crafting_table_items and added 'minecraft:geometry' to asphalt and sidewalk blocks for improved geometry definition.

[177] 66e09edc1d4255a482f602dce2d40e771e3ba131 | 2025-11-22 23:22:04 -0300 | dt=+119s
