      Subject: Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/TazoLaTaza/Decayed-Reality
      Stat   : 0 files changed (merge or empty tree diff)

[178] c7f9f28f33a78356d05dfb73ec764cf9bedc2cc2 | 2025-11-23 14:14:07 -0300 | dt=+53523s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: cdd84a2f83f563c55184f5c035391271f3f578a2
      Subject: Enhance Wither Storm ambience and cluster effects
      Stat   : 17 files changed, 464 insertions(+), 220 deletions(-)
      Body   : Updated ambience controllers and sound effect animations for Wither Storm, including new storm SFX states and sound mappings. Improved cluster particle effects and renamed cluster trail to cluster leftovers. Adjusted cluster pull and chase parameters in scripts for better gameplay feel. Added new tractor beam SFX animation and locators for commanded wither beams. Fixed minor logic and naming issues in entity and animation files.

[179] 331ec8d544a431a6d30980735d5ce62f5a6c8e19 | 2025-11-24 00:27:36 -0300 | dt=+36809s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: 05c7c1ea494d739c0733af64580ea1d80e026445
      Subject: Wither Storm multiblock and tick logic
      Stat   : 76 files changed, 2060 insertions(+), 8878 deletions(-)
      Body   : Simplifies and optimizes Wither Storm multiblock detection and spawning logic, replacing legacy structure matching with a more robust approach. Removes unused vector helpers and cluster vortex code from WitherStormTick.js, focusing tick logic on storm growth, player chase, and passive evolution. Updates entity behavior and animation parameters for wither_admin, and reorganizes scripts for better modularity.

[180] 1919d172b3dfd8681273c00bb4b5b0e1bcbc811e | 2025-11-24 12:31:08 -0300 | dt=+43412s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: 55476f7ef26c2337e2e8f2990397864c974a4660
      Subject: before gdk migration
      Stat   : 4 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

[181] c44155ee2b25dd09055df3193c723f0e814b1933 | 2025-11-24 14:39:34 -0300 | dt=+7706s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: ba092d8feca49e0352d9bad20ffb7598c6ba3dd7
      Subject: Increase Wither dash force and add relocate animation
      Stat   : 3 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
      Body   : Raised DASH_FORCE and SIDE_FORCE values in WitherCombat.js to enhance Wither movement. Added 'animation.wither_admin.relocate' to commanded_wither_spawn.animation.json for new Wither relocation animation. Removed unused potions import from main.js.

[182] 9951542d9c10e45afee33578d8abbeb3769ec84d | 2025-12-01 23:01:01 -0300 | dt=+634887s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: fc3f3e635661cc4a3dda5a6044673b8d7299594c
      Subject: m
      Stat   : 6 files changed, 182 insertions(+), 277 deletions(-)

[183] 88c1b325de33bd4f0cd97dd9035e10b4a16751c1 | 2025-12-06 10:24:39 -0300 | dt=+386618s
      Author : TazoLaTaza <[redacted-owner-email]> | Tree: 92012be7e9eb5b809ae9ead46d6708fd87aaf836
      Subject: music and ambience
      Stat   : 80 files changed, 34176 insertions(+), 20126 deletions(-)
      Body   : Replaced 'bigWitherGrowth' with 'destroyerWitherGrowth' across entities, animations, and functions for consistency. Removed unused flydown and dynamic flight animations, and updated Wither Storm growth stage thresholds. Added new tentacle attack properties and events, improved sound and music triggers for ambience and evolution, and introduced new ambient storm and music theme systems. Refactored enderman entity behaviors and added/removed various assets for skybox, sounds, models, and particles.

